OL,3,GNEWSAScabies outbreak at hospital
OL,4,Acloses wards
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Welsh hospital has restricted
OL,7,Fvisitors and closed two wards following
OL,8,Fan outbreak of scabies.
OL,10,FHywel Dda health board said the wards
OL,11,Fat Prince Philip Hospital in Llanelli,
OL,12,FCarmarthenshire, were shut because of
OL,13,Fthe infection, and visitors had been
OL,14,Flimited since Sunday.
OL,16,FScabies is a highly contagious skin
OL,17,Finfestation caused by microscopic mites
OL,18,Fthat burrow under the skin and spread
OL,19,Fthrough close skin contact.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
