OL,3,GNEWSAScabies outbreak at hospital
OL,4,Acloses wards
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe health board said a number of cases
OL,7,Fwere being managed in healthcare and
OL,8,Fthe community, which covers
OL,9,FCarmarthenshire, Ceredigion, and
OL,10,FPembrokeshire, and the risk to the
OL,11,Fwider public was low.
